    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2115\ud835\udd56\ud835\udd60\u2102\ud835\udd52\ud835\udd63\ud835\udd64</h2></strong><br>Is a cyberpunk driving game that offers an immersive experience in a futuristic universe. <br>The game's concept is based on creating lines every time your car moves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c6f5ca050785cad5005190125ba9e0b6.poster.avif?t=1741351593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c6f5ca050785cad5005190125ba9e0b6.webm?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c6f5ca050785cad5005190125ba9e0b6.mp4?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud835\udd3b\ud835\udd63\ud835\udd5a\ud835\udd57\ud835\udd65</h2></strong><br>And you must skillfully drift to make these lines deadly for anything that passes through them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/59989a1edbdbc395a7f7dc5b36563b21.poster.avif?t=1741351593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/59989a1edbdbc395a7f7dc5b36563b21.webm?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/59989a1edbdbc395a7f7dc5b36563b21.mp4?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud835\udd4a\ud835\udd52\ud835\udd66\ud835\udd65 \ud835\udd4b\ud835\udd56\ud835\udd5e\ud835\udd61\ud835\udd60\ud835\udd63\ud835\udd56\ud835\udd5d\ud835\udd64</h2></strong><br>Unless you use your car's ability to perform temporal jumps to teleport and avoid the lines.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c275c8816b73fadbf3d41e8914c2e922.poster.avif?t=1741351593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c275c8816b73fadbf3d41e8914c2e922.webm?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c275c8816b73fadbf3d41e8914c2e922.mp4?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><br>The game offers solo, local cooperative, and online multiplayer modes for up to four players. An interesting feature of the game is the ball system with colors, which adds a competitive and strategic dimension. You must avoid players of a different color to avoid being eliminated, but you can also choose to team up with players wearing the same color.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/60ea12e64fa9a62fd47d86903f382852.poster.avif?t=1741351593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/60ea12e64fa9a62fd47d86903f382852.webm?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/60ea12e64fa9a62fd47d86903f382852.mp4?t=1741351593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><br>This also: In summary, NeoCars is an exciting and original cyberpunk driving game that offers an immersive experience in a futuristic universe. With its concept of deadly lines and its color-coded ball system, NeoCars provides a stimulating gameplay experience that will satisfy players who are keen on competition and strategy.",
